<title>ANTIGUA AND BARBUDA: CRICKET-RED STRIPE SCORES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-RED STRIPE SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>ST JOHN'S, Antigua 1997-02-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Close of play scores on</p>
<p>the second day of four day Red Stripe Cup matches played</p>
<p>Saturday:</p>
<p>In St John's: Leewards Islands 352 (R.Jacobs 107) v Trinidad</p>
<p>and Tobago.</p>
<p>In Georgetown: Guyana v Jamaica no play - rain.</p>
<p>In Grenada: Barbados 161; Windward Islands 82-7.</p>
</text>
